// Toolset management.

%locale: 
%namespace: toolset

create: Create toolset
remove: Remove toolset
rename: Rename toolset
shared: Shared toolset:
use_custom: Use custom toolset
use_custom.hint: Edits apply only to this agent. When disabled, a shared toolset configuration is used.
tools_enabled_by_default: Enable unchanged tools by default
tools_enabled_by_default.hint: When checked, tools without an explicit per-agent override are enabled by default. Uncheck to disable all unchanged tools.
default_approval_level: Default approval level
